      "_comment_editable_fields": "Which api_fields a human can fill in when a pet has no provider, and how. api_fields above describes where a value comes FROM a provider; this describes how a value is ENTERED by hand. Each entry here is registered as post meta (_pet_<name>) and takes precedence over the API snapshot at hydration time, so a manual pet needs no provider and a synced pet is unaffected. Fields absent from this list are provider-internal (bonded_group_id, bonded_pet_ids, youtube_urls) and have no manual equivalent.",
      "editable_field_groups": {
        "basics": "Basics",
        "health": "Health",
        "compatibility": "Good with",
        "adoption": "Adoption",
        "media": "Media"
      },
